{"id":92,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Gaseous and completely impalpable. Also highly dangerous— inhaling part of its poisonous body will cause one to faint instantly."},{"games":["Shield","HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"With its gas-like body, it can sneak into any place it desires. However, it can be blown away by wind."},{"games":["Sword","Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Born from gases, anyone would faint if engulfed by its gaseous body, which contains poison."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Said to appear in decrepit, deserted buildings. It has no real shape, as it appears to be made of a gas."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Poisonous gas comprises 95% of its body. It’s said that the remaining 5% is made up of the souls of those who died from the gas."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It’s said that gas emanating from a graveyard was possessed by the grievances of the deceased and thus became a Pokémon."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"Although Gastly is barely visible, when it’s near, a faint sweet smell lingers."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Should a strange light be seen flickering in an abandoned building, Gastly is lurking there."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Gastly is largely composed of gaseous matter. When exposed to a strong wind, the gaseous body quickly dwindles away. Groups of this Pokémon cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver"],"text":"Its body is made of gas. Despite lacking substance, it can envelop an opponent of any size and cause suffocation."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"A Pokémon born from poison gases. It defeats even the largest foes by enveloping them in gas."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"This Pokémon’s body is 95% made up of gases, which are blown away by strong gusts of wind."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Blue","Red"],"text":"Almost invisible, this gaseous POKéMON cloaks the target and puts it to sleep without notice."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"A being that exists as a thin gas. It can topple an Indian elephant by enveloping the prey in two seconds."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"When exposed to a strong wind, a GASTLY’s gaseous body quickly dwindles away. They cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It wraps its opponent in its gas- like body, slowly weakening its prey by poisoning it through the skin."},{"games":["Silver"],"text":"Its thin body is made of gas. It can envelop an opponent of any size and cause suffocation."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Levitate","hidden":false,"description":"By floating in the air, the Pokémon receives full immunity to all Ground-type moves."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"cave","color":"Purple","shape":"Ball","evolution":{"id":92,"name":"Gastly","condition":null,"children":[{"id":93,"name":"Haunter","condition":"Lv. 25","children":[{"id":94,"name":"Gengar","condition":"Trade","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,109],[1,122],[4,95],[8,212],[12,371],[16,180],[20,174],[24,506],[28,101],[32,389],[36,399],[40,247],[44,194],[48,138]],"machine":[491,109,174,399,605,203,412,263,7,492,202,441,114,506,8,196,286,417,101,220,398,809,182,244,94,240,156,184,247,285,806,214,188,482,180,164,241,269,851,168,87,9,85,92,271,433,474,261],"egg":[310,499,50,114,195,513,123,92],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv5-177","name":"Gastly","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"177","artist":"Mousho","img":"sv5/177"},{"id":"me3-48","name":"Gastly","set":"Perfect Order","date":"2026-03-27","rarity":"Common","number":"48","artist":null,"small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me3-48/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me3-48/large"},{"id":"me2pt5-123","name":"Gastly","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30",